<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3652/62  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.6924/29  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9034/39  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4778/88  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     34.91/95   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.7162/72  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1694.2/5.2 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     120.65/70  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.5367/17  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.7572/92  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4560/90  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4257/67  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7811/16  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7440/50  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6253/58</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$362.20/362.70</p>
</text>
